# M1 keeps compact, reviewable source contracts and final evidence in Git.
# VCS executables/csrc trees, Design Compiler work databases, binary DDC, and
# raw run logs are reproducible from the versioned RTL, scripts, SDF, SDC, and
# curated text/JSON reports, so they remain local under this task-owned root.
synthesis/work/
synthesis/netlist/*.ddc
synthesis/run/
verification/**/run/
